  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building of Integrated Water Resources Management and Sustainable Development, Philippines  .</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increase management and technical skills of officials and staff of national and local units involved in the planning and programming of water resources-related infrastructure through the conduct of capacity building on IWRM and sustainable development to support the Government of the Philippines (GPH) continued efforts towards the improved delivery of water supply, sanitation, and irrigation services, and coordinated flood control and management under the IWRM framework. Strengthen the bilateral cooperation between the Philippines and Republic of Korea in the water resources sector.1. &#xC911;&#xC7A5;&#xAE30; &#xBB3C;&#xBD84;&#xC57C; &#xD611;&#xB825; &#xD6A8;&#xACFC;&#xC131; &#xC81C;&#xACE0;, 2. &#xD544;&#xB9AC;&#xD540; &#xBB3C;&#xAD00;&#xB9AC; &#xB2A5;&#xB825; &#xD5A5;&#xC0C1;</narrative>
  </description>
